 <entry>
  <id>yt:video:9DWKeH56YGg</id>
  <yt:videoId>9DWKeH56YGg</yt:videoId>
  <yt:channelId>UC5f97D60yHa7UE9rFfbej8g</yt:channelId>
  <title>Hyundai’s India Journey: 30 Years of Scale, Trust and Progress</title>
  <link rel="alternate" href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9DWKeH56YGg"/>
  <author>
   <name>HyundaiWorldwide</name>
   <uri>https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5f97D60yHa7UE9rFfbej8g</uri>
  </author>
  <published>2026-10-14T02:30:29+00:00</published>
  <updated>2026-10-18T00:42:02+00:00</updated>
  <media:group>
   <media:title>Hyundai’s India Journey: 30 Years of Scale, Trust and Progress</media:title>
   <media:content url="https://www.youtube.com/v/9DWKeH56YGg?version=3" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" width="640" height="390"/>
   <media:thumbnail url="https://i2.ytimg.com/vi/9DWKeH56YGg/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>For 30 years, Hyundai has grown alongside India—earning the trust of millions of customers, building a deeply local manufacturing and supplier ecosystem, and helping shape the country’s mobility ambitions.

Through iconic models such as SANTRO, CRETA and IONIQ 5, this film traces Hyundai’s journey from a challenger in a growing car market to a technology-led company helping accelerate India’s transition towards cleaner mobility.

Featuring perspectives from Hyundai leadership and customers, this film explores how localization, innovation and long-term commitment have helped make India Hyundai Motor’s second-largest market—and a key hub for the future.

